gui-input-log 1
platform wayland
window 480 320 1
source synthesized, not recorded: a touchpad on Wayland through libinput. wl_pointer.axis events with axis_source finger, in surface pixels, one frame every 7-12 ms while the fingers move, and an axis_stop when they lift (no momentum: kinetic scrolling is the client's, as GTK's gtkeventcontrollerscroll.c does it); winit 0.30 (platform_impl/linux/wayland/seat/pointer/mod.rs) makes the first started, the rest moved, the stop ended with a zero PixelDelta. Three gestures: lifted while moving, lifted 60 ms after the fingers stopped, and lifted 200 ms after; then a wheel, whose axis_discrete steps winit makes LineDelta.
